# Local-only acceptance photos (public repo — never publish; spec decision 6).
# Trailing "/*" (not "/") is load-bearing: a bare directory-match pattern
# makes git prune the whole dir from traversal, and a negation line for a
# file inside it below is then never even evaluated (confirmed empirically
# with `git check-ignore -v` while wiring Task 6 — see task-6-report.md).
# The "/*" form still excludes everything by default but keeps the dir
# itself traversable so the README negation below actually takes effect.
digitizer/testdata/photo/acceptance/*
# ...except the dir's own explainer (Task 6) — must follow the exclude
# above to take effect (gitignore negation order rule).
!digitizer/testdata/photo/acceptance/README.md
